| G-ARTIFACT-RA-DEPTH-SCHEMA-001 | depth_triage artifact: `step=step1-depth-triage`, `status=complete`, `gate_b=PASS`, `analysis_depth` ∈ {standard, deep, deferred} |
| G-ARTIFACT-RA-DEPTH-CONSIST-001 | 最終 envelope の `analysis_depth` が depth_triage の結果と整合（standard→standard / deep→deep or standard+fallback_reason / deferred→standard or deep） |
